        "text": "Looks like this is a dependency graph. Have you considered more traditional DAG layout systems (GraphViz)?",
        "team": "T5TCAFTA9",
        "thread_ts": "1768049007.158959",
        "parent_user_id": "U02E4DAQGSZ",
        "blocks": [
            {
                "type": "rich_text",
